            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is multifactorial, requiring multi-dimensional treatment. The cross-disciplinary care provided in pain assessment and treatment centres offers patients a global treatment. As a complement to conventional treatment, the patient's care pathway may include psycho-corporal therapy with psychotherapeutic input.</AbstractText>
